{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>韓國hetras固態除臭罐</h2>\n<p>韓國香氛品牌hetras近日推出固態除臭凝膠，標榜「邊除臭、邊留香」，據官方測試，最快5分鐘便能去除99.9%致臭物質，一罐更可持續使用約120天，成為近期家居除臭的熱門之選。\n</p>\n<h2>成份天然</h2>\n<p>hetras採用「吸附、中和、分解、香氣護理」四步除臭循環，產品以植物萃取成分為主，並通過多項安全測試，標榜適合有寵物或幼童的家庭使用。不過，使用時仍應放在兒童和寵物不易接觸的位置，避免誤食。使用方法非常簡單：只需用隨附開罐器打開上蓋，放在浴室、鞋櫃、衣櫃、廚房或玄關等容易積聚異味的角落即可。</p>\n<h2>5款香味選擇</h2>\n<p>官方指出，單罐可持續運作長達120天；當罐內凝膠揮發至剩餘約10%時，便應更換。共推出5款香氣，包括Olive Young獨家的水仙花（Soosunhwa）、靈感來自濟州森林的濟州森林木質香（Jeju Saryeoni Forest）、柔軟慵懶的髒棉花（Dirty Cotton）、乾淨清甜的雛菊（Daisy），以及營造高級酒店氛圍的經典飯店木質香（Hotel Wood）。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439122276015652_12540131706af43cb75baa0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439122276015652_12540131706af43cb75baa0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943912252757057_15497027386af43cb9be83a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943912252757057_15497027386af43cb9be83a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439122742079013_6077139966af43cbbd3a6f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439122742079013_6077139966af43cbbd3a6f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943912293806201_9892962686af43cbdca67d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943912293806201_9892962686af43cbdca67d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfmAL7Ok_Ai/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:16:24.594208+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":557,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:30:03.490207+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:45.878941+00:00","content_hash":"1614e8530bfa6c26acd1a7b199bb4c1673d0c29b9a7f464a7934690f21aee1a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}